msgid "Someone"
msgstr "Quelqu'un"

msgid "You're invited to teach"
msgstr "Vous êtes invité à enseigner"

#. Translators: %(name)s is the invitee's first name; "Hi there," is the
#. greeting without one.
msgid "Hi %(name)s,"
msgstr "Bonjour %(name)s,"

#. Translators: the greeting when the email's sender doesn't know the person's
#. name.
msgid "Hi there,"
msgstr "Bonjour,"

#. Translators: %(inviter)s is the name of the person who sent the invitation.
msgid ""
"%(inviter)s added you as an instructor. You'll see the sessions you teach, "
"your learners and their progress."
msgstr ""
"%(inviter)s vous a ajouté comme enseignant. Vous verrez les séances que vous"
" animez, vos apprenants et leur progression."

msgid "Set up your account"
msgstr "Configurer votre compte"

msgid "This invitation expires on %(day)s."
msgstr "Cette invitation expire le %(day)s."

msgid "You got this email because %(inviter)s invited %(email)s to teach."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car %(inviter)s a invité %(email)s à enseigner."

msgid "%(count)s seat"
msgid_plural "%(count)s seats"
msgstr[0] "%(count)s place"
msgstr[1] "%(count)s places"

#. Translators: two seat lists ("20 seats in Fire safety", "5 seats in First
#. aid"); %(first)s may itself be
#. two or more lists joined by this same sentence.
msgid "%(first)s and %(second)s"
msgstr "%(first)s et %(second)s"

#. Translators: %(seats)s is a number of seats ("20 seats"); %(where)s is what
#. they are for.
msgid "%(seats)s in %(where)s"
msgstr "%(seats)s dans %(where)s"

#. Translators: what was bought when the order names no batch, in "Your order
#. for seats is confirmed".
msgid "seats"
msgstr "places"

msgid "%(tenant)s's manager"
msgstr "Gestionnaire de %(tenant)s"

msgid "You're invited to manage %(tenant)s"
msgstr "Vous êtes invité à gérer %(tenant)s"

msgid "You've been invited to manage %(tenant)s."
msgstr "Vous avez été invité à gérer %(tenant)s."

msgid "Sign in with this email address and open the link below to accept:"
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous avec cette adresse e-mail et ouvrez le lien ci-dessous pour "
"accepter :"

#. Translators: %(days)s is a number of days.
msgid ""
"The link works for %(days)s days. If you ask for a new one, this one stops "
"working."
msgstr ""
"Le lien est valable %(days)s jours. Si vous en demandez un nouveau, celui-ci"
" cessera de fonctionner."

#. Translators: %(inviter)s is a person's name; %(role)s is the role's name in
#. bold.
msgid "%(inviter)s invited you as %(role)s."
msgstr "%(inviter)s vous a invité en tant que %(role)s."

msgid "Hi,"
msgstr "Bonjour,"

msgid "%(inviter)s invited you to join %(organisation)s as %(role)s."
msgstr ""
"%(inviter)s vous a invité à rejoindre %(organisation)s en tant que %(role)s."

msgid "Accept the invitation:"
msgstr "Acceptez l'invitation :"

msgid "You're invited to join %(organisation)s"
msgstr "Vous êtes invité à rejoindre %(organisation)s"

msgid "Accept the invitation"
msgstr "Accepter l'invitation"

msgid "%(inviter)s gave you the %(role)s role at %(organisation)s."
msgstr "%(inviter)s vous a attribué le rôle %(role)s chez %(organisation)s."

msgid "Sign in:"
msgstr "Connectez-vous :"

msgid "Your role at %(organisation)s"
msgstr "Votre rôle chez %(organisation)s"

#. Translators: %(address)s is the platform's web address.
msgid ""
"Hi %(name)s, your platform is live at %(address)s with your logo, colours "
"and emails set up."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour %(name)s, votre plateforme est en ligne à l'adresse %(address)s, "
"avec votre logo, vos couleurs et vos e-mails configurés."

msgid ""
"Hi, your platform is live at %(address)s with your logo, colours and emails "
"set up."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour, votre plateforme est en ligne à l'adresse %(address)s, avec votre "
"logo, vos couleurs et vos e-mails configurés."

msgid ""
"Hi %(name)s, your platform is live with your logo, colours and emails set "
"up."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour %(name)s, votre plateforme est en ligne, avec votre logo, vos "
"couleurs et vos e-mails configurés."

msgid "Hi, your platform is live with your logo, colours and emails set up."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour, votre plateforme est en ligne, avec votre logo, vos couleurs et vos"
" e-mails configurés."

msgid "%(organisation)s is ready"
msgstr "%(organisation)s est prête"

msgid ""
"When you sign in, a setup guide walks you through your first course, batch "
"and team. It takes about 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Lors de votre connexion, un guide de configuration vous accompagne dans la "
"création de votre premier cours, de votre première promotion et de votre "
"équipe. Cela prend environ 30 minutes."

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Se connecter"

msgid "This link works once and expires on %(day)s."
msgstr "Ce lien n'est utilisable qu'une fois et expire le %(day)s."

#. Translators: %(specialist)s is a person's name and email address, or "the
#. Blend-ed team".
msgid "Your onboarding specialist is %(specialist)s."
msgstr "Votre spécialiste de l'intégration est %(specialist)s."

msgid "You got this email because %(organisation)s was set up for %(email)s."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car %(organisation)s a été configurée pour "
"%(email)s."

msgid "the Blend-ed team"
msgstr "l'équipe Blend-ed"

msgid "You're invited to learn with %(name)s"
msgstr "Vous êtes invité à apprendre avec %(name)s"

msgid "%(name)s has invited you to learn with them."
msgstr "%(name)s vous invite à apprendre avec lui."

#. Translators: %(days)s is a number of days.
msgid ""
"The link works for %(days)s days. If a new one is sent, this one stops "
"working."
msgstr ""
"Le lien est valable %(days)s jours. Si un nouveau lien est envoyé, celui-ci "
"cessera de fonctionner."

#. Translators: {date} is the day the link stops working ("19 November 2026
#. UTC": the address has no account to
#. take a time zone from).
msgid ""
"The link works until {date}. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Le lien est valable jusqu'au {date}. Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette"
" demande, ignorez cet e-mail."

#. Translators: {workspace} is the name of the AI workspace being opened.
msgid "Confirm your {workspace} workspace"
msgstr "Confirmez votre espace de travail {workspace}"

#. Translators: {workspace} is the name of the AI workspace being opened.
msgid ""
"Someone asked to open the AI workspace \"{workspace}\" with this email "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Quelqu'un a demandé à ouvrir l'espace de travail AI « {workspace} » avec "
"cette adresse e-mail."

msgid ""
"Sign in, or create an account, with this email address, then open the link "
"below to confirm it:"
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous, ou créez un compte, avec cette adresse e-mail, puis ouvrez "
"le lien ci-dessous pour le confirmer :"

msgid ""
"Sign in, or create an account, with this email address, then confirm the "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous, ou créez un compte, avec cette adresse e-mail, puis "
"confirmez l'espace de travail."

msgid "Confirm your workspace"
msgstr "Confirmez votre espace de travail"

#. Translators: {email} is the address the workspace was requested for.
msgid "You got this email because a workspace was requested for {email}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car un espace de travail a été demandé pour {email}."

#. Translators: {workspace} is the AI workspace's name; {email} the address to
#. sign in with.
msgid ""
"Your AI workspace {workspace} is set up and you manage it. Sign in with "
"{email} to start building courses with AI."
msgstr ""
"Votre espace de travail AI {workspace} est configuré et vous en êtes le "
"gestionnaire. Connectez-vous avec {email} pour commencer à créer des cours "
"avec l'AI."

#. Translators: {workspace} is the AI workspace's name.
msgid "Your {workspace} workspace is ready"
msgstr "Votre espace de travail {workspace} est prêt"

msgid "Pick up where you left off"
msgstr "Reprenez là où vous vous êtes arrêté"

msgid ""
"You haven't opened your courses for a while. A few minutes today keeps you "
"on track, and your progress is waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez pas ouvert vos cours depuis un moment. Quelques minutes "
"aujourd'hui suffisent pour rester sur la bonne voie, et votre progression "
"vous attend."

#. Translators: {who} is the person asking, {library} the library's title and
#. {note} their own message.
msgid "{who} asks to edit the library {library}. “{note}”"
msgstr "{who} demande à modifier la bibliothèque {library}. « {note} »"

msgid "{who} asks to edit the library {library}."
msgstr "{who} demande à modifier la bibliothèque {library}."

#. Translators: {library} is the library's title.
msgid "Access request for {library}"
msgstr "Demande d'accès pour {library}"

msgid "{count} open response to grade"
msgid_plural "{count} open responses to grade"
msgstr[0] "{count} réponse ouverte à noter"
msgstr[1] "{count} réponses ouvertes à noter"

msgid "{count} offline result not entered"
msgid_plural "{count} offline results not entered"
msgstr[0] "{count} résultat hors ligne non saisi"
msgstr[1] "{count} résultats hors ligne non saisis"

#. Translators: {id} is the learner's account number, shown when they have no
#. name.
msgid "Learner {id}"
msgstr "Apprenant {id}"

#. Translators: {names} is a comma-separated list of learner names.
msgid "{count} learner below the passing grade: {names}"
msgid_plural "{count} learners below the passing grade: {names}"
msgstr[0] "{count} apprenant sous le seuil de réussite : {names}"
msgstr[1] "{count} apprenants sous le seuil de réussite : {names}"

#. Translators: {line} is the list of learners above; {more} how many more are
#. not named.
msgid "{line} and {more} more"
msgstr "{line} et {more} de plus"

#. Translators: {day} is a day and month ("19 November"), "19 November UTC"
#. for a
#. person who chose no time zone.
msgid "Your action items for {day}"
msgstr "Vos actions pour {day}"

msgid "Certificate expired"
msgstr "Certificat expiré"

msgid "Your certificate has expired. Take the course again to renew it."
msgstr ""
"Votre certificat a expiré. Suivez à nouveau le cours pour le renouveler."

msgid "Renew"
msgstr "Renouveler"

msgid "a deadline"
msgstr "une échéance"

msgid "Due dates moved in {batch}"
msgstr "Dates d’échéance déplacées dans {batch}"

msgid "Extensions removed in {batch}"
msgstr "Prolongations supprimées dans {batch}"

msgid ""
"{actor} moved the due date for {assessment} for {count} learners to {new}."
msgstr ""
"{actor} a déplacé la date d’échéance de {assessment} pour {count} apprenants"
" au {new}."

msgid ""
"{actor} removed the extended due date for {assessment} for {count} learners."
msgstr ""
"{actor} a supprimé la date d’échéance prolongée de {assessment} pour {count}"
" apprenants."

msgid "Extension removed in {batch}"
msgstr "Prolongation supprimée dans {batch}"

#. Translators: {old} and {new} are dates such as "12 Mar"; {reason} is the
#. staff member's words.
msgid ""
"{actor} removed {learner}'s extended due date for {assessment}: it is back "
"to {new} (it was {old}). Reason: {reason}"
msgstr ""
"{actor} a supprimé la date d’échéance prolongée de {learner} pour "
"{assessment} : elle revient au {new} (c’était le {old}). Motif : {reason}"

msgid ""
"{actor} removed {learner}'s extended due date for {assessment} (it was "
"{old}). Reason: {reason}"
msgstr ""
"{actor} a supprimé la date d’échéance prolongée de {learner} pour "
"{assessment} (c’était le {old}). Motif : {reason}"

msgid "Due date moved in {batch}"
msgstr "Date d’échéance déplacée dans {batch}"

msgid ""
"{actor} moved {learner}'s due date for {assessment} from {old} to {new}. "
"Reason: {reason}"
msgstr ""
"{actor} a déplacé la date d’échéance de {learner} pour {assessment} du {old}"
" au {new}. Motif : {reason}"

msgid ""
"{actor} gave {learner} a new due date for {assessment}: {new}. Reason: "
"{reason}"
msgstr ""
"{actor} a donné à {learner} une nouvelle date d’échéance pour {assessment} :"
" {new}. Motif : {reason}"

msgid "Due dates changed in {batch}"
msgstr "Dates d’échéance modifiées dans {batch}"

msgid "Due dates changed in {count} of your Batches"
msgstr "Dates d’échéance modifiées dans {count} de vos promotions"

msgid "{actor} changed the due dates of {course}."
msgstr "{actor} a modifié les dates d’échéance de {course}."

msgid "{name}, you earned a Program certificate!"
msgstr "{name}, vous avez obtenu un certificat de programme !"

msgid "About this certificate"
msgstr "À propos de ce certificat"

msgid "Certificate ID"
msgstr "ID du certificat"

msgid "Date of issue"
msgstr "Date de délivrance"

msgid "Invoice"
msgstr "Facture"

msgid "Order"
msgstr "Commande"

msgid "Purchase order"
msgstr "Bon de commande"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "Statut"

msgid "Paid in full"
msgstr "Entièrement payé"

msgid "Amount due"
msgstr "Montant dû"

msgid "Due by"
msgstr "À rendre avant le"

msgid ""
"Here is invoice %(invoice)s against purchase order %(po)s for order "
"%(order)s from %(seller)s. The PDF is attached."
msgstr ""
"Voici la facture %(invoice)s relative au bon de commande %(po)s pour la "
"commande %(order)s de %(seller)s. Le PDF est joint."

msgid ""
"Here is invoice %(invoice)s for order %(order)s from %(seller)s. The PDF is "
"attached."
msgstr ""
"Voici la facture %(invoice)s pour la commande %(order)s de %(seller)s. Le "
"PDF est joint."

msgid "Invoice %(invoice)s"
msgstr "Facture %(invoice)s"

msgid "It is paid in full."
msgstr "Le montant est entièrement réglé."

msgid "The seats are yours once it is paid."
msgstr "Les places vous appartiennent dès le paiement effectué."

msgid "View your order"
msgstr "Voir votre commande"

msgid "Sign in as one of the company's managers to open the order."
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous en tant que l'un des gestionnaires de l'entreprise pour "
"ouvrir la commande."

msgid ""
"You got this email because this address is the billing email for the order."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car cette adresse est l'adresse de facturation de la"
" commande."

msgid "Invoice %(invoice)s from %(seller)s"
msgstr "Facture %(invoice)s de %(seller)s"

msgid "Claim your free place at %(seller)s"
msgstr "Réclamez votre place gratuite chez %(seller)s"

msgid "A free place at %(seller)s was requested for this email address."
msgstr ""
"Une place gratuite chez %(seller)s a été demandée pour cette adresse e-mail."

msgid ""
"Sign in, or create an account, with this email address, then open the link "
"below to claim it:"
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous, ou créez un compte, avec cette adresse e-mail, puis ouvrez "
"le lien ci-dessous pour la réclamer :"

msgid ""
"The link works until %(day)s. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Le lien est valable jusqu'au %(day)s. Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de "
"cette demande, ignorez cet e-mail."

msgid "Claim your place"
msgstr "Réclamer votre place"

#. Translators: %(seats)s is a number of seats ("20 seats"); %(target)s a
#. course and %(batch)s its intake.
msgid "%(seats)s of %(target)s (%(batch)s)"
msgstr "%(seats)s sur %(target)s (%(batch)s)"

msgid "Quote %(number)s"
msgstr "Devis %(number)s"

msgid ""
"Here is quote %(number)s from %(seller)s for %(of)s. The PDF is attached."
msgstr ""
"Voici le devis %(number)s de %(seller)s pour %(of)s. Le PDF est joint."

msgid ""
"To go ahead, order the seats from your catalog, or reply to this email."
msgstr ""
"Pour continuer, commandez les places depuis votre catalogue ou répondez à "
"cet e-mail."

msgid "Quote"
msgstr "Devis"

msgid "Seats"
msgstr "Places"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "Total"

msgid "Valid until"
msgstr "Valable jusqu’au"

msgid "Order the seats"
msgstr "Commander les places"

msgid ""
"This quote holds no seats. Prices and seats are confirmed when the order is "
"placed."
msgstr ""
"Ce devis ne réserve aucune place. Les prix et les places sont confirmés lors"
" de la commande."

msgid ""
"You got this email because %(organisation)s sent a quote to %(tenant)s."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car %(organisation)s a envoyé un devis à %(tenant)s."

msgid "Quote %(number)s from %(seller)s"
msgstr "Devis %(number)s de %(seller)s"

msgid "card"
msgstr "carte"

msgid "bank transfer"
msgstr "virement bancaire"

msgid "account credit"
msgstr "crédit sur le compte"

msgid "Your receipt for order %(number)s"
msgstr "Votre reçu pour la commande %(number)s"

#. Translators: %(total)s is money with its currency.
msgid ""
"Your payment of %(total)s for order %(number)s went through. You can start "
"learning now."
msgstr ""
"Votre paiement de %(total)s pour la commande %(number)s a été accepté. Vous "
"pouvez commencer à apprendre dès maintenant."

msgid "Go to my learning"
msgstr "Accéder à mon apprentissage"

msgid "Your purchase"
msgstr "Votre achat"

msgid "Subtotal"
msgstr "Sous-total"

msgid "Discount"
msgstr "Remise"

msgid "Tax (included)"
msgstr "Taxe (incluse)"

msgid "Tax"
msgstr "Taxe"

msgid "Total paid"
msgstr "Total payé"

msgid "your purchase"
msgstr "votre achat"

msgid ""
"It goes back the way you paid; your bank may take a few days to show it."
msgstr ""
"Le montant est reversé sur votre moyen de paiement ; votre banque peut "
"mettre quelques jours à l'afficher."

msgid "We have paid it back to you directly."
msgstr "Nous vous l'avons remboursé directement."

msgid "It is kept as credit on your account for your next purchase."
msgstr ""
"Il est conservé sous forme de crédit sur votre compte pour votre prochain "
"achat."

msgid "Your refund for order %(number)s"
msgstr "Votre remboursement pour la commande %(number)s"

#. Translators: %(amount)s is money with its currency; %(how)s is a sentence
#. on how it is paid back.
msgid "We are refunding %(amount)s for order %(number)s. %(how)s"
msgstr "Nous remboursons %(amount)s pour la commande %(number)s. %(how)s"

msgid "your course"
msgstr "votre cours"

#. Translators: %(learner)s is a person's name; %(title)s a course or program.
msgid "%(learner)s bought %(title)s"
msgstr "%(learner)s a acheté %(title)s"

msgid "%(learner)s bought %(title)s and can start now."
msgstr "%(learner)s a acheté %(title)s et peut commencer dès maintenant."

msgid "%(learner)s enrolled in %(title)s"
msgstr "%(learner)s s'est inscrit à %(title)s"

msgid "%(learner)s enrolled themselves in %(title)s."
msgstr "%(learner)s s'est inscrit lui-même à %(title)s."

msgid "your subscription"
msgstr "votre abonnement"

msgid ""
"We couldn't take your payment of %(amount)s for %(name)s. Update your "
"payment method by %(day)s to keep your access."
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons pas pu encaisser votre paiement de %(amount)s pour %(name)s. "
"Mettez à jour votre moyen de paiement avant le %(day)s pour conserver votre "
"accès."

msgid ""
"We couldn't take your payment of %(amount)s for %(name)s. Update your "
"payment method to keep your access."
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons pas pu encaisser votre paiement de %(amount)s pour %(name)s. "
"Mettez à jour votre moyen de paiement pour conserver votre accès."

msgid "Your %(name)s payment couldn't be processed"
msgstr "Votre paiement %(name)s n'a pas pu être traité"

msgid "We couldn't process your subscription payment."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas pu traiter le paiement de votre abonnement."

#. Translators: shown after a time written in UTC because the person chose no
#. time zone; {url} is the link
#. to their Settings page.
msgid "Shown in UTC. Set your time zone in Settings: {url}"
msgstr ""
"Affiché en UTC. Définissez votre fuseau horaire dans Paramètres : {url}"

#. Translators: shown after a time written in UTC because the person chose no
#. time zone.
msgid "Shown in UTC. Set your time zone in Settings."
msgstr "Affiché en UTC. Définissez votre fuseau horaire dans Paramètres."

#. Translators: {time} is a time of day ("15:30"); {zone} a time zone's name
#. ("Asia/Kolkata").
msgid "{time} in {zone}"
msgstr "{time} ({zone})"

#. Translators: {name} is the course's title.
msgid "{name} finished building. Open it in Studio to review and publish it."
msgstr ""
"La génération de {name} est terminée. Ouvrez-le dans Studio pour le vérifier"
" et le publier."

msgid "{count} component could not be generated and need your attention."
msgid_plural ""
"{count} components could not be generated and need your attention."
msgstr[0] ""
"{count} composant n'a pas pu être généré et requiert votre attention."
msgstr[1] ""
"{count} composants n'ont pas pu être générés et requièrent votre attention."

#. Translators: {name} is the course's title.
msgid "Your course {name} is ready"
msgstr "Votre cours {name} est prêt"

msgid "Open in Studio"
msgstr "Ouvrir dans Studio"

msgid "You do not have access to this course."
msgstr "Vous n’avez pas accès à ce cours."

#. Translators: {timestamp} is when the report arrived ("2026-11-19 09:30:00
#. UTC").
msgid "Crashlytics error report ({timestamp})"
msgstr "Rapport d'erreur Crashlytics ({timestamp})"

msgid "I completed the {course_title} course on {course_org_name}."
msgstr "J’ai terminé le cours {course_title} sur {course_org_name}."

msgid ""
"I completed a course at {course_org_name}. Take a look at my certificate."
msgstr ""
"J’ai terminé un cours chez {course_org_name}. Découvrez mon certificat."

msgid "%(fullname)s, you earned a certificate!"
msgstr "%(fullname)s, vous avez obtenu un certificat !"

msgid "Awarded to:"
msgstr "Décerné à :"

msgid "Recipient Image"
msgstr "Image du destinataire"

msgid "Validity"
msgstr "Validité"

msgid "Does not expire"
msgstr "N’expire pas"

msgid "Share on"
msgstr "Partager sur"

msgid "Post on Facebook"
msgstr "Publier sur Facebook"

msgid "Tweet this Accomplishment"
msgstr "Tweeter cette réussite"

msgid "Add to LinkedIn Profile"
msgstr "Ajouter au profil LinkedIn"

msgid "Download PDF"
msgstr "Télécharger le PDF"

msgid "This is to certify that"
msgstr "Nous certifions que"

#. Translators: follows the learner's name, which the certificate shows on its
#. own line above; the sentence's subject is that name.
msgid "has successfully completed %(course_name)s offered by %(org_name)s"
msgstr "a terminé avec succès %(course_name)s proposé par %(org_name)s"

msgid "Date of Issue: %(date)s"
msgstr "Date de délivrance : %(date)s"

msgid "Programme"
msgstr "Programme"

msgid "Verified"
msgstr "Vérifié"

#. Translators: follows the learner's name, which the certificate shows on its
#. own line above; the sentence's subject is that name.
msgid ""
"has successfully completed and was awarded this certificate for the "
"programme above."
msgstr ""
"a terminé avec succès le programme ci-dessus et s’est vu décerner ce "
"certificat."

msgid ""
"has successfully completed, received a passing grade, and was awarded this "
"certificate for the course above."
msgstr ""
"a terminé avec succès le cours ci-dessus, a obtenu une note de passage et "
"s’est vu décerner ce certificat."

msgid "Issued on %(date)s"
msgstr "Délivré le %(date)s"

msgid "Valid until %(date)s"
msgstr "Valable jusqu’au %(date)s"

msgid "Sincerely,"
msgstr "Cordialement,"

msgid "Supported by the following organizations"
msgstr "Avec le soutien des organisations suivantes"

msgid "Certificate of Attendance"
msgstr "Certificat de présence"

msgid "Noted by"
msgstr "Noté par"

msgid "This certificate has been revoked"
