"Sent to the person a company's paid first purchase names, to set up the "
"account that manages it."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé à la personne désignée dans le premier achat payé d'une entreprise, "
"pour configurer le compte qui la gère."

#. Translators: {{ tenant_possessive }} is the company's name, possessive
#. ("Bolt Freight's"). You may
#. write {{ tenant_name }} instead, the name alone ("Bolt Freight"), where
#. your language puts it another way.
msgid "Set up your account to manage {{ tenant_possessive }} seats"
msgstr ""
"Configurez votre compte pour gérer les places de {{ tenant_possessive }}"

msgid "Recipient first name"
msgstr "Prénom du destinataire"

msgid "Company name"
msgstr "Nom de l'entreprise"

msgid "Company name, possessive"
msgstr "Nom de l'entreprise, forme possessive"

msgid "Set-up link"
msgstr "Lien de configuration"

msgid "Company account — Set up (order recorded)"
msgstr "Compte entreprise — Configuration (commande enregistrée)"

msgid ""
"Sent when staff record a company's first order to be paid by invoice, to set"
" up its account."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé lorsque le personnel enregistre la première commande d'une entreprise"
" payable sur facture, pour configurer son compte."

msgid "What was ordered"
msgstr "Ce qui a été commandé"

msgid "Company account — Co-manager invitation"
msgstr "Compte entreprise — Invitation de co-gestionnaire"

msgid ""
"Sent when a company's manager invites someone to manage the company's seats "
"with them."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé lorsqu'un gestionnaire d'entreprise invite quelqu'un à gérer avec lui"
" les places de l'entreprise."

#. Translators: {{ tenant_possessive }} is the company's name, possessive
#. ("Bolt Freight's"). You may
#. write {{ tenant_name }} instead, the name alone ("Bolt Freight"), where
#. your language puts it another way.
msgid "Help manage {{ tenant_possessive }} seats"
msgstr "Aidez à gérer les places de {{ tenant_possessive }}"

msgid "Who invited them"
msgstr "Qui les a invités"

msgid "Company account — Active"
msgstr "Compte entreprise — Actif"

msgid ""
"Sent to a company's managers when the organisation activates the company's "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé aux gestionnaires d'une entreprise lorsque l'organisation active le "
"compte de l'entreprise."

msgid "{{ tenant_name }} is ready"
msgstr "{{ tenant_name }} est prête"

msgid "Invite your people"
msgstr "Invitez vos collaborateurs"

msgid "Manager first name"
msgstr "Prénom du gestionnaire"

msgid "How many people may learn at once"
msgstr "Nombre de personnes pouvant apprendre simultanément"

msgid "The seats ready to give out"
msgstr "Places prêtes à être attribuées"

msgid "Tenant manager link"
msgstr "Lien du gestionnaire de l'organisation cliente"

msgid "Company account — Choose who keeps access"
msgstr "Compte entreprise — Choisir qui conserve l'accès"

msgid ""
"Sent to a company's managers when a renewal lowers the learner limit below "
"the people it has."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé aux gestionnaires d'une entreprise lorsqu'un renouvellement fixe la "
"limite d'apprenants en dessous du nombre actuel de personnes."

msgid "Choose people"
msgstr "Choisir les personnes"

msgid "The new contract's end"
msgstr "Fin du nouveau contrat"

msgid "The new learner limit"
msgstr "Nouvelle limite d'apprenants"

msgid "People learning now"
msgstr "Personnes en cours d'apprentissage"

msgid "Date to choose by"
msgstr "Date limite pour choisir"

msgid "Choose people link"
msgstr "Lien « Choisir les personnes »"

msgid "Company account — On hold for payment"
msgstr "Compte d’entreprise — Suspendu en attente de paiement"

msgid ""
"Sent to a company's managers when its account is put on hold for payment."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé aux responsables d’une entreprise lorsque son compte est suspendu en "
"attente de paiement."

msgid "{{ tenant_name }} is on hold for payment"
msgstr "{{ tenant_name }} est suspendu en attente de paiement"

msgid "Open orders and billing"
msgstr "Ouvrir les commandes et la facturation"

msgid "Date it happened"
msgstr "Date de l’événement"

msgid "The reason given for the company (rendered)"
msgstr "Le motif indiqué pour l’entreprise (rendu)"

msgid "Orders and billing link"
msgstr "Lien vers les commandes et la facturation"

msgid "Company account — Payment hold ended"
msgstr "Compte d’entreprise — Fin de la suspension de paiement"

msgid ""
"Sent to a company's managers when the payment hold on its account ends."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé aux responsables d’une entreprise lorsque la suspension de paiement "
"de son compte prend fin."

msgid "{{ tenant_name }} is no longer on hold"
msgstr "{{ tenant_name }} n’est plus suspendu"

msgid "Open your account"
msgstr "Ouvrir votre compte"

msgid "Company account — Blocked"
msgstr "Compte d’entreprise — Bloqué"

msgid "Sent to a company's managers when the organisation blocks its account."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé aux responsables d’une entreprise lorsque l’organisation bloque son "
"compte."

msgid "{{ tenant_name }} is blocked"
msgstr "{{ tenant_name }} est bloqué"

msgid "Company account — Unblocked"
msgstr "Compte d’entreprise — Débloqué"

msgid ""
"Sent to a company's managers when the organisation unblocks its account."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé aux responsables d’une entreprise lorsque l’organisation débloque son"
" compte."

msgid "{{ tenant_name }} is unblocked"
msgstr "{{ tenant_name }} est débloqué"

msgid "Tenant — Asks to renew"
msgstr "Organisation cliente — Demande de renouvellement"

msgid ""
"Sent to the people who can renew a tenant when its manager asks to renew."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé aux personnes pouvant renouveler une organisation cliente lorsque son"
" responsable demande un renouvellement."

msgid "{{ tenant_name }} asks to renew"
msgstr "{{ tenant_name }} demande un renouvellement"

msgid "Open the tenant"
msgstr "Ouvrir l’organisation cliente"

msgid "First name"
msgstr "Prénom"

msgid "The manager who asked"
msgstr "Le responsable ayant fait la demande"

msgid "Date they asked"
msgstr "Date de la demande"

msgid "Tenant page link"
msgstr "Lien vers la page de l’organisation cliente"

msgid "Hi {{ full_name }},"
msgstr "Bonjour {{ full_name }},"

#. Translators: %(course)s is the course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"You have a place in %(course)s at {{ org_name }}. Open it any time from My "
"learning."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une place dans %(course)s chez {{ org_name }}. Ouvrez-le à tout "
"moment depuis Mon apprentissage."

msgid "You got this email because you were enrolled in {{ course_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous avez été inscrit à {{ course_name }}."

msgid "Your enrollment in {{ course_name }} changed"
msgstr "Votre inscription à {{ course_name }} a changé"

#. Translators: %(course)s is the course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"Your access to %(course)s at {{ org_name }} changed. Open the course to see "
"what's new; you carry on from where you left off."
msgstr ""
"Votre accès à %(course)s chez {{ org_name }} a changé. Ouvrez le cours pour "
"découvrir les nouveautés ; vous reprenez là où vous vous étiez arrêté."

msgid ""
"You got this email because your enrollment in {{ course_name }} changed."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car votre inscription à {{ course_name }} a changé."

msgid "You earned your {{ course_name }} certificate"
msgstr "Vous avez obtenu votre certificat {{ course_name }}"

#. Translators: %(course)s is the course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You passed %(course)s at {{ org_name }} and earned its "
"certificate. You can view it, download it and share it."
msgstr ""
"Félicitations ! Vous avez réussi %(course)s chez {{ org_name }} et obtenu "
"son certificat. Vous pouvez le consulter, le télécharger et le partager."

msgid "You got this email because you completed {{ course_name }}."
msgstr "Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous avez terminé {{ course_name }}."

#. Translators: %(course)s is the course's name in bold; {{ expired_on }} is a
#. date.
msgid ""
"Your certificate for %(course)s at {{ org_name }} expired on {{ expired_on "
"}}."
msgstr ""
"Votre certificat pour %(course)s chez {{ org_name }} a expiré le {{ "
"expired_on }}."

msgid ""
"Your graded attempts and scores for the course were reset, so you can start "
"fresh. Pass the assessments again and a new certificate is issued "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Vos tentatives notées et vos scores pour le cours ont été réinitialisés afin"
" que vous puissiez repartir de zéro. Réussissez à nouveau les évaluations et"
" un nouveau certificat sera délivré automatiquement."

msgid ""
"You got this email because you held a certificate for {{ course_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous déteniez un certificat pour {{ course_name "
"}}."

msgid "You're invited to join {{ display_name }}"
msgstr "Vous êtes invité à rejoindre {{ display_name }}"

#. Translators: %(name)s is the organisation's or course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"You're invited to join %(name)s on {{ platform_name }}. Accept the "
"invitation to get started."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes invité à rejoindre %(name)s sur {{ platform_name }}. Acceptez "
"l'invitation pour commencer."

#. Translators: %(address)s is the invited email address in bold.
msgid ""
"Sign in or register with %(address)s: the invitation is for this address."
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous ou inscrivez-vous avec %(address)s : l'invitation est "
"destinée à cette adresse."

msgid ""
"This link works until {{ expires_on }}. If a new invitation is sent, this "
"one stops working."
msgstr ""
"Ce lien est valable jusqu'au {{ expires_on }}. Si une nouvelle invitation "
"est envoyée, celui-ci cessera de fonctionner."

msgid ""
"You got this email because someone at {{ org_name }} invited {{ "
"email_address }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car quelqu'un chez {{ org_name }} a invité {{ "
"email_address }}."

#. Translators: %(role)s is the role's name in bold.
msgid ""
"{{ inviter_name }} gave you the %(role)s role at {{ org_name }}. Sign in to "
"get started."
msgstr ""
"{{ inviter_name }} vous a attribué le rôle %(role)s chez {{ org_name }}. "
"Connectez-vous pour commencer."

msgid "You got this email because you were given a role at {{ org_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car un rôle vous a été attribué chez {{ org_name }}."

#. Translators: %(workspace)s is the new organisation's name in bold.
msgid ""
"Thanks for signing up for the AI Course Creator free trial on {{ "
"platform_name }}. Your workspace, %(workspace)s, is set up and your account "
"is active. Sign in to start building courses with AI."
msgstr ""
"Merci de vous être inscrit à l'essai gratuit d'AI Course Creator sur {{ "
"platform_name }}. Votre espace de travail, %(workspace)s, est configuré et "
"votre compte est actif. Connectez-vous pour commencer à créer des cours avec"
" l'AI."

#. Translators: %(address)s is the organisation's reply-to email address, as a
#. link.
msgid "Questions? Write to %(address)s."
msgstr "Des questions ? Écrivez à %(address)s."

msgid ""
"You got this email because you signed up for a free trial with {{ "
"email_address }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous vous êtes inscrit à un essai gratuit avec "
"{{ email_address }}."

msgid ""
"The password for your {{ platform_name }} account ({{ email_address }}) was "
"changed on {{ changed_at }}."
msgstr ""
"Le mot de passe de votre compte {{ platform_name }} ({{ email_address }}) a "
"été modifié le {{ changed_at }}."

#. Translators: %(not_you)s is "Wasn't you?" in bold; %(address)s is the
#. reply-to email address, as a link.
msgid ""
"%(not_you)s Reset your password now from the sign-in page and contact "
"%(address)s."
msgstr ""
"%(not_you)s Réinitialisez dès maintenant votre mot de passe depuis la page "
"de connexion et contactez %(address)s."

msgid "Wasn't you?"
msgstr "Ce n'était pas vous ?"

msgid ""
"You got this email because the password of your account changed. It can't be"
" switched off."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car le mot de passe de votre compte a été modifié. "
"Il ne peut pas être désactivé."

msgid "{{ raised_by }} raised a ticket."
msgstr "{{ raised_by }} a ouvert un ticket."

msgid "Type"
msgstr "Type"

msgid ""
"You got this email because you get support ticket alerts at {{ org_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous recevez les alertes de tickets d'assistance"
" chez {{ org_name }}."

msgid "Claim your place at {{ org_name }}"
msgstr "Réclamez votre place chez {{ org_name }}"

msgid "Your place is waiting:"
msgstr "Votre place vous attend :"

#. Translators: %(address)s is the buyer's email address in bold.
msgid ""
"Sign in or create an account with %(address)s, then claim your place: it is "
"for this address."
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous ou créez un compte avec %(address)s, puis réclamez votre "
"place : elle est réservée à cette adresse."

msgid ""
"This link works until {{ expires_on }}. If you didn't ask for this, ignore "
"this email."
msgstr ""
"Ce lien est valable jusqu'au {{ expires_on }}. Si vous n'êtes pas à "
"l'origine de cette demande, ignorez cet e-mail."

msgid ""
"You got this email because a place at {{ org_name }} was requested for {{ "
"email_address }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car une place chez {{ org_name }} a été demandée "
"pour {{ email_address }}."

msgid "Thanks for your purchase"
msgstr "Merci pour votre achat"

msgid "Hi {{ first_name }},"
msgstr "Bonjour {{ first_name }},"

msgid ""
"Your payment to {{ org_name }} went through. Here is your receipt for order "
"{{ order_number }}, paid on {{ order_date }}."
msgstr ""
"Votre paiement à {{ org_name }} a été accepté. Voici votre reçu pour la "
"commande {{ order_number }}, payée le {{ order_date }}."

msgid "Paid by {{ payment_method }}. You can start learning now."
msgstr ""
"Payé par {{ payment_method }}. Vous pouvez commencer à apprendre dès "
"maintenant."

msgid ""
"You got this email because you bought {{ items }} on {{ platform_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous avez acheté {{ items }} sur {{ "
"platform_name }}."

#. Translators: {{ reason }} is the payment provider's sentence; %(amount)s is
#. the currency and amount in
#. bold; %(plan)s is the plan's name in bold.
msgid ""
"{{ reason }} We tried to take %(amount)s for %(plan)s and the payment didn't"
" go through, so your access has ended."
msgstr ""
"{{ reason }} Nous avons tenté de prélever %(amount)s pour %(plan)s, mais le "
"paiement n'a pas abouti ; votre accès a donc pris fin."

msgid "Update your payment method to subscribe again."
msgstr "Mettez à jour votre moyen de paiement pour vous réabonner."

msgid ""
"You got this email because you subscribe to {{ plan_name }} with {{ "
"email_address }}. It can't be switched off."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous êtes abonné à {{ plan_name }} avec {{ "
"email_address }}. Il ne peut pas être désactivé."

#. Translators: %(name)s is the course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} enrolled you in %(name)s on {{ platform_name }}. Complete "
"your registration to open it."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} vous a inscrit à %(name)s sur {{ platform_name }}. Finalisez "
"votre inscription pour y accéder."

#. Translators: %(address)s is the enrolled email address in bold.
msgid "Register with %(address)s: the place is for this address."
msgstr ""
"Inscrivez-vous avec %(address)s : la place est réservée à cette adresse."

msgid ""
"You got this email because {{ org_name }} enrolled {{ email_address }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car {{ org_name }} a inscrit {{ email_address }}."

msgid "You got this email because {{ org_name }} sent it to you."
msgstr "Vous recevez cet e-mail car {{ org_name }} vous l'a envoyé."

msgid "Mobile app crash reported"
msgstr "Plantage de l'application mobile signalé"

msgid "The {{ platform_name }} mobile app reported a crash."
msgstr "L'application mobile {{ platform_name }} a signalé un plantage."

msgid ""
"You got this email because it is the crash report address of {{ "
"platform_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car il s'agit de l'adresse de rapport de plantage de"
" {{ platform_name }}."

msgid ""
"Your order for {{ order_summary }} is confirmed, and {{ tenant_name }} now "
"has an account at {{ org_name }}. Set up your sign-in to manage it."
msgstr ""
"Votre commande de {{ order_summary }} est confirmée, et {{ tenant_name }} "
"dispose désormais d'un compte chez {{ org_name }}. Configurez votre "
"connexion pour le gérer."

msgid ""
"Once {{ org_name }} activates the account, you can invite your people, book "
"their sessions and follow their progress."
msgstr ""
"Dès que {{ org_name }} aura activé le compte, vous pourrez inviter vos "
"collaborateurs, réserver leurs séances et suivre leur progression."

msgid "This link works until {{ expires_on }}."
msgstr "Ce lien est valable jusqu'au {{ expires_on }}."

msgid "You got this email because you bought seats for {{ tenant_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous avez acheté des places pour {{ tenant_name "
"}}."

#. Translators: {{ tenant_possessive }} is the company's name, possessive
#. ("Bolt Freight's"). You may
#. write {{ tenant_name }} instead, the name alone ("Bolt Freight"), where
#. your language puts it another way.
msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} recorded {{ tenant_possessive }} order for {{ order_summary "
"}}. We'll email the invoice to you."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} a enregistré la commande de {{ tenant_possessive }} pour {{ "
"order_summary }}. Nous vous enverrons la facture par e-mail."

msgid ""
"Set up your sign-in to manage the seats. Once {{ org_name }} activates the "
"account, you can invite your people and book their sessions."
msgstr ""
"Configurez votre connexion pour gérer les places. Dès que {{ org_name }} "
"aura activé le compte, vous pourrez inviter vos collaborateurs et réserver "
"leurs séances."

msgid ""
"You got this email because {{ org_name }} recorded an order for {{ "
"tenant_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car {{ org_name }} a enregistré une commande pour {{"
" tenant_name }}."

#. Translators: {{ tenant_possessive }} is the company's name, possessive
#. ("Bolt Freight's"). You may
#. write {{ tenant_name }} instead, the name alone ("Bolt Freight"), where
#. your language puts it another way.
msgid ""
"{{ inviter_name }} invited you to manage {{ tenant_possessive }} account at "
"{{ org_name }} with them. Set up your sign-in to invite people, book their "
"sessions and follow their progress."
msgstr ""
"{{ inviter_name }} vous invite à gérer avec lui le compte de {{ "
"tenant_possessive }} chez {{ org_name }}. Configurez votre connexion pour "
"inviter des personnes, réserver leurs séances et suivre leur progression."

msgid ""
"You got this email because {{ inviter_name }} invited you to manage {{ "
"tenant_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car {{ inviter_name }} vous a invité à gérer {{ "
"tenant_name }}."

msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} activated your account. You can have up to {{ learner_limit "
"}} people learning at once."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} a activé votre compte. Jusqu'à {{ learner_limit }} personnes "
"peuvent apprendre simultanément."

#. Translators: {{ seats_summary }} is a whole sentence, such as "Your 20
#. seats in Fire safety are ready
#. to give out."
msgid "{{ seats_summary }} Invite your people, then book their sessions."
msgstr ""
"{{ seats_summary }} Invitez vos collaborateurs, puis réservez leurs séances."

msgid "You got this email because you manage {{ tenant_name }}."
msgstr "Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous gérez {{ tenant_name }}."

#. Translators: {{ tenant_possessive }} is the company's name, possessive
#. ("Bolt Freight's"). You may
#. write {{ tenant_name }} instead, the name alone ("Bolt Freight"), where
#. your language puts it another way.
msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} renewed {{ tenant_possessive }} contract until {{ "
"renewed_until }} with a learner limit of {{ learner_limit }}. You have {{ "
"active_learners }} people."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} a renouvelé le contrat de {{ tenant_possessive }} jusqu'au {{"
" renewed_until }} avec une limite de {{ learner_limit }} apprenants. Vous "
"avez {{ active_learners }} personnes."

msgid ""
"Choose the {{ learner_limit }} who keep access before {{ choose_by }}. Until"
" you choose, everyone stays as they are now."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez les {{ learner_limit }} personnes qui conservent l'accès avant le"
" {{ choose_by }}. Tant que vous n'avez pas choisi, tout le monde reste dans "
"la situation actuelle."

msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} put {{ tenant_name }} on hold for payment on {{ changed_on "
"}}. Learning your company pays for is paused until this is cleared. "
"Everyone's progress and certificates are kept."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} a suspendu {{ tenant_name }} en attente de paiement le {{ "
"changed_on }}. L’apprentissage financé par votre entreprise est suspendu "
"jusqu’à la régularisation. La progression et les certificats de chacun sont "
"conservés."

msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} ended the payment hold on {{ tenant_name }} on {{ changed_on "
"}}. Your people can carry on with their learning."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} a mis fin à la suspension de paiement de {{ tenant_name }} le"
" {{ changed_on }}. Vos collaborateurs peuvent poursuivre leur apprentissage."

msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} blocked {{ tenant_name }} on {{ changed_on }}. Nobody can use"
" your company's account or the learning it pays for until it is unblocked."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} a bloqué {{ tenant_name }} le {{ changed_on }}. Personne ne "
"peut utiliser le compte de votre entreprise ni l’apprentissage qu’elle "
"finance tant qu’il n’est pas débloqué."

msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} unblocked {{ tenant_name }} on {{ changed_on }}. You and your"
" people can sign in and carry on."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} a débloqué {{ tenant_name }} le {{ changed_on }}. Vous et vos"
" collaborateurs pouvez vous connecter et poursuivre."

msgid ""
"{{ requester_name }}, who manages {{ tenant_name }}, asked on {{ "
"requested_on }} to renew the company's contract."
msgstr ""
"{{ requester_name }}, responsable de {{ tenant_name }}, a demandé le {{ "
"requested_on }} le renouvellement du contrat de l’entreprise."

msgid "Renew the contract from the tenant's page."
msgstr "Renouvelez le contrat depuis la page de l’organisation cliente."

msgid "You got this email because you can renew tenants at {{ org_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous pouvez renouveler les organisations "
"clientes chez {{ org_name }}."

msgid "your program"
msgstr "votre programme"

msgid "Your enrollment in %(title)s was updated"
msgstr "Votre inscription à %(title)s a été mise à jour"

msgid "You're enrolled in %(title)s"
msgstr "Vous êtes inscrit à %(title)s"

msgid "Your access to %(title)s changed. Open the course to see what's new."
msgstr ""
"Votre accès à %(title)s a changé. Ouvrez le cours pour découvrir les "
"nouveautés."

msgid "You have a place in %(title)s. Open it from My learning."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une place dans %(title)s. Ouvrez-le depuis Mon apprentissage."

msgid "Go to my program"
msgstr "Accéder à mon programme"

msgid "You've earned your %(title)s certificate"
msgstr "Vous avez obtenu votre certificat %(title)s"

msgid "Congratulations! You passed %(title)s and earned its certificate."
msgstr "Félicitations ! Vous avez réussi %(title)s et obtenu son certificat."

msgid "You got this email because of your notification settings."
msgstr "Vous recevez cet e-mail en raison de vos paramètres de notification."

msgid "A learner"
msgstr "Un apprenant"

msgid "%(who)s completed %(title)s on a seat from %(tenant)s."
msgstr "%(who)s a terminé %(title)s avec une place de %(tenant)s."

msgid "%(who)s passed %(title)s on a seat from %(tenant)s."
msgstr "%(who)s a réussi %(title)s avec une place de %(tenant)s."

#. Translators: %(who)s is a learner's name; %(title)s a course or program.
msgid "%(who)s finished %(title)s"
msgstr "%(who)s a terminé %(title)s"

msgid "%(email)s hasn't accepted your invitation"
msgstr "%(email)s n'a pas accepté votre invitation"

#. Translators: %(day)s is the date the invitation was sent.
msgid ""
"You invited %(email)s to learn with %(tenant)s on %(day)s, and they haven't "
"accepted yet. You can send the invitation again from People."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez invité %(email)s à apprendre avec %(tenant)s le %(day)s, et cette "
"personne n'a pas encore accepté. Vous pouvez renvoyer l'invitation depuis "
"Personnes."

msgid "a course"
msgstr "un cours"

#. Translators: %(seats)s is a number of seats ("3 seats"); %(where)s what
#. they are for.
msgid "%(seats)s in %(where)s not given out yet"
msgstr "%(seats)s dans %(where)s pas encore attribuées"

msgid ""
"%(tenant)s still has %(seats)s to give out in %(where)s. Enrollment closes "
"on %(day)s; seats not given by then can't be used."
msgstr ""
"%(tenant)s a encore %(seats)s à attribuer dans %(where)s. Les inscriptions "
"ferment le %(day)s ; les places non attribuées d'ici là ne pourront pas être"
" utilisées."

msgid "Order %(number)s is paid"
msgstr "La commande %(number)s est payée"

#. Translators: %(total)s is money with its currency; %(tenant)s a company.
msgid ""
"We received %(total)s for %(tenant)s's order %(number)s. Its seats are ready"
" to give out."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons reçu %(total)s pour la commande %(number)s de %(tenant)s. Ses "
"places sont prêtes à être attribuées."

msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Politique de confidentialité"

msgid "Terms of use"
msgstr "Conditions d'utilisation"

msgid "%(tenant)s is ready"
msgstr "%(tenant)s est prête"

#. Translators: %(limit)s is a number of people.
msgid ""
"Your account is active. You can have up to %(limit)s people learning at "
"once."
msgstr ""
"Votre compte est actif. Jusqu'à %(limit)s personnes peuvent apprendre "
"simultanément."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name; %(limit)s is a number of
#. people.
msgid ""
"%(tenant)s's contract was renewed with a learner limit of %(limit)s. Choose "
"who keeps access."
msgstr ""
"Le contrat de %(tenant)s a été renouvelé avec une limite de %(limit)s "
"apprenants. Choisissez qui conserve l'accès."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s is on hold for payment"
msgstr "%(tenant)s est suspendu en attente de paiement"

msgid ""
"Learning your company pays for is paused until this is cleared. Progress and"
" certificates are kept."
msgstr ""
"L’apprentissage financé par votre entreprise est suspendu jusqu’à la "
"régularisation. La progression et les certificats sont conservés."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s is no longer on hold"
msgstr "%(tenant)s n’est plus suspendu"

msgid ""
"The payment hold has ended. Your people can carry on with their learning."
msgstr ""
"La suspension de paiement a pris fin. Vos collaborateurs peuvent poursuivre "
"leur apprentissage."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s is blocked"
msgstr "%(tenant)s est bloqué"

msgid ""
"Nobody can use your company's account or the learning it pays for until it "
"is unblocked."
msgstr ""
"Personne ne peut utiliser le compte de votre entreprise ni l’apprentissage "
"qu’elle finance tant qu’il n’est pas débloqué."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s is unblocked"
msgstr "%(tenant)s est débloqué"

msgid "You and your people can sign in and carry on."
msgstr "Vous et vos collaborateurs pouvez vous connecter et poursuivre."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name.
msgid "%(tenant)s asks to renew"
msgstr "%(tenant)s demande un renouvellement"

#. Translators: %(who)s is a person's name, %(tenant)s the company they manage
#. and %(note)s their own
#. message.
msgid ""
"%(who)s, who manages %(tenant)s, asked to renew the company's contract. "
"“%(note)s”"
msgstr ""
"%(who)s, responsable de %(tenant)s, a demandé le renouvellement du contrat "
"de l’entreprise. « %(note)s »"

#. Translators: %(who)s is a person's name; %(tenant)s is the company they
#. manage.
msgid ""
"%(who)s, who manages %(tenant)s, asked to renew the company's contract."
msgstr ""
"%(who)s, responsable de %(tenant)s, a demandé le renouvellement du contrat "
"de l’entreprise."

#. Translators: %(seats)s lists the seats, such as "20 seats in Fire safety
#. and 5 seats in First aid".
msgid "Your %(seats)s is ready to give out."
msgid_plural "Your %(seats)s are ready to give out."
msgstr[0] "Votre %(seats)s est prête à être attribuée."
msgstr[1] "Vos %(seats)s sont prêtes à être attribuées."

msgid "An invoice is overdue."
msgstr "Une facture est en retard."

msgid "The overdue invoice is settled."
msgstr "La facture en retard est réglée."

msgid "The reason given:"
msgstr "Le motif indiqué :"

msgid "Grades"
msgstr "Notes"

msgid "Enrollments"
msgstr "Inscriptions"

msgid "Certificates"
msgstr "Certificats"

msgid "Session attendance"
msgstr "Présence aux séances"

msgid "Learner progress"
msgstr "Progression de l'apprenant"

msgid "Every answer"
msgstr "Chaque réponse"

msgid "Submissions"
msgstr "Soumissions"

msgid "Anonymous IDs"
msgstr "Identifiants anonymes"

msgid "Video views"
msgstr "Vues des vidéos"

msgid "Assessment scores"
msgstr "Notes des évaluations"

msgid "Invited, not enrolled"
msgstr "Invité, non inscrit"

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name.
msgid "Your {report} report is ready"
msgstr "Votre rapport {report} est prêt"

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name.
msgid "The {report} report for this course is ready to download."
msgstr "Le rapport {report} de ce cours est prêt à être téléchargé."

msgid "Download the report"
msgstr "Télécharger le rapport"

msgid "Your data is ready to download"
msgstr "Vos données sont prêtes à être téléchargées"

#. Translators: {days} is how many days the download link works.
msgid ""
"Your data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The link "
"works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Vos données sont prêtes : un fichier zip regroupant tout ce que Blend-ed "
"conserve. Le lien est valable {days} jours, et uniquement pour vous."

#. Translators: the title when the person whose data was exported no longer
#. has an account.
msgid "this person's data is ready to download"
msgstr "Les données de cette personne sont prêtes à être téléchargées"

#. Translators: the message when the person whose data was exported no longer
#. has an account; {days} is
#. how many days the link works.
msgid ""
"this person's data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The "
"link works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Les données de cette personne sont prêtes : un fichier zip regroupant tout "
"ce que Blend-ed conserve. Le lien est valable {days} jours, et uniquement "
"pour vous."

#. Translators: {name} is the person whose data was exported.
msgid "{name}'s data is ready to download"
msgstr "Les données de {name} sont prêtes à être téléchargées"

#. Translators: {name} is the person whose data was exported; {days} how many
#. days the link works.
msgid ""
"{name}'s data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The link "
"works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Les données de {name} sont prêtes : un fichier zip regroupant tout ce que "
"Blend-ed conserve. Le lien est valable {days} jours, et uniquement pour "
"vous."

msgid "Download the file"
msgstr "Télécharger le fichier"

msgid "Your full export is ready to download"
msgstr "Votre export complet est prêt à être téléchargé"

#. Translators: {days} is how many days the download link works.
msgid ""
"Your full export is ready: one zip file of your platform's records. The link"
" works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Votre export complet est prêt : un fichier zip regroupant les données de "
"votre plateforme. Le lien est valable {days} jours, et uniquement pour vous."

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name; {start} and {end} are dates
#. (YYYY-MM-DD),
#. {end} followed by the period's time zone ("2026-11-23 UTC").
msgid "The {report} report for {start} to {end} is ready to download."
msgstr "Le rapport {report} du {start} au {end} est prêt à être téléchargé."

#. Translators: {month} is the month just ended with its time zone ("October
#. 2026 UTC"); the others are
#. counts.
msgid ""
"{month}. Seats in use: {assigned} of {funded}. New seats: {new_seats}. "
"Results recorded: {results}. Certificates earned: {certificates}."
msgstr ""
"{month}. Places utilisées : {assigned} sur {funded}. Nouvelles places : "
"{new_seats}. Résultats enregistrés : {results}. Certificats obtenus : "
"{certificates}."

#. Translators: {end} is the week's last day, a Sunday, with its time zone
#. ("22 November 2026 UTC"); the others
#. are counts.
msgid ""
"Week to {end}. Seats in use: {assigned} of {funded}. New seats: {new_seats}."
" Results recorded: {results}. Certificates earned: {certificates}."
msgstr ""
"Semaine jusqu'au {end}. Places utilisées : {assigned} sur {funded}. "
"Nouvelles places : {new_seats}. Résultats enregistrés : {results}. "
"Certificats obtenus : {certificates}."

#. Translators: {tenant} is the company's name.
msgid "{tenant}: your month in learning"
msgstr "{tenant} : votre mois d’apprentissage"

#. Translators: {tenant} is the company's name.
msgid "{tenant}: your week in learning"
msgstr "{tenant} : votre semaine d'apprentissage"

#. Translators: {name} is the instructor's name; {title} is the session's
#. name.
msgid "{name} is away for {title}"
msgstr "{name} est absent pour {title}"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name, {when} the date's start and
#. {name} the instructor's name.
msgid ""
"{title} on {when} falls in {name}'s time off. They are still its instructor "
"until you change it."
msgstr ""
"{title} le {when} tombe pendant le congé de {name}. Cette personne reste "
"l'enseignant tant que vous ne le modifiez pas."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; the instructor's name is not
#. known.
msgid "An instructor is away for {title}"
msgstr "Un enseignant est absent pour {title}"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name and {when} the date's start; the
#. instructor's name is not
#. known.
msgid ""
"{title} on {when} falls in the instructor's time off. They are still its "
"instructor until you change it."
msgstr ""
"{title} le {when} tombe pendant le congé de l’enseignant. Cette personne "
"reste l’enseignant tant que vous ne le modifiez pas."

msgid "{name}, you earned a Session certificate!"
msgstr "{name}, vous avez obtenu un certificat de séance !"

#. Translators: {part} is the date's number within the session; {title} is the
#. session's name.
msgid "Part {part} of {title}"
msgstr "Partie {part} de {title}"

#. Translators: {by} is who moved the date; {title} the date's name; {when}
#. the new date and time, {was}
#. the old one.
msgid "{by} moved {title} to {when} (it was {was})."
msgstr "{by} a déplacé {title} au {when} (initialement le {was})."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("{title} was moved to …"). {when} is the new date and
#. time, {was} the old one.
msgid "moved {title} to {when} (it was {was})."
msgstr "a déplacé {title} au {when} (initialement le {was})."

msgid "{title} moved"
msgstr "{title} déplacé"

#. Translators: {by} is who cancelled the date; {title} the date's name; {was}
#. the date and time it had.
msgid "{by} cancelled {title}, {was}."
msgstr "{by} a annulé {title}, {was}."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("{title}, {was}, was cancelled."). {was} is the date and
#. time it had.
msgid "cancelled {title}, {was}."
msgstr "a annulé {title}, {was}."

msgid "{title} cancelled"
msgstr "{title} annulé"

#. Translators: {by} is who added the instructor; {title} the date's name;
#. {when} its date and time.
msgid "{by} added you to {title}, {when}."
msgstr "{by} vous a ajouté à {title}, {when}."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("You were added to {title}, {when}."). {when} is the
#. date and time.
msgid "added you to {title}, {when}."
msgstr "vous a ajouté à {title}, {when}."

msgid "You're teaching {title}"
msgstr "Vous enseignez {title}"

#. Translators: {by} is who changed the date's instructors; {title} the date's
#. name; {was} its date and time.
msgid "{by} changed its instructors; {title} on {was} is not yours any more."
msgstr ""
"{by} a modifié ses enseignants ; {title} du {was} ne vous est plus attribué."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a complete
#. sentence ("Its instructors changed; …"). {was} is the date and time.
msgid "changed its instructors; {title} on {was} is not yours any more."
msgstr ""
"a modifié ses enseignants ; {title} du {was} ne vous est plus attribué."

msgid "You're no longer teaching {title}"
msgstr "Vous n'enseignez plus {title}"

msgid "Confirm attendance for {title}"
msgstr "Confirmez la présence pour {title}"

msgid "{title} has ended. Confirm who attended."
msgstr "{title} est terminé. Confirmez qui était présent."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {minutes} how many minutes
#. until it starts. English keeps
#. "minutes" even for 1.
msgid "{title} starts in {minutes} minutes"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {minutes} minutes"
msgstr[0] "{title} commence dans {minutes} minutes"
msgstr[1] "{title} commence dans {minutes} minutes"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {when} its start date and time.
msgid "{title} starts at {when}."
msgstr "{title} commence le {when}."

msgid "Tomorrow: {count} session"
msgid_plural "Tomorrow: {count} sessions"
msgstr[0] "Demain : {count} séance"
msgstr[1] "Demain : {count} séances"

msgid "{count} new submission to review"
msgid_plural "{count} new submissions to review"
msgstr[0] "{count} nouvelle soumission à évaluer"
msgstr[1] "{count} nouvelles soumissions à évaluer"

#. Translators: {batch} is the batch's name; {count} how many submissions wait
#. for a grade.
msgid "{batch}: {count} submission waiting for a grade."
msgid_plural "{batch}: {count} submissions waiting for a grade."
msgstr[0] "{batch} : {count} soumission en attente de note."
msgstr[1] "{batch} : {count} soumissions en attente de note."

msgid "Weekly review due for {batches}"
msgstr "Bilan hebdomadaire à faire pour {batches}"

msgid "below the passing score"
msgstr "sous le seuil de réussite"

msgid "not active for 14 days"
msgstr "inactif depuis 14 jours"

msgid "not active for 7 days"
msgstr "inactif depuis 7 jours"

msgid "behind on progress"
msgstr "en retard dans sa progression"

msgid "has not started"
msgstr "n’a pas commencé"

msgid "failed an assessment"
msgstr "a échoué à une évaluation"

msgid "behind schedule"
msgstr "en retard"

msgid "{name} needs help"
msgstr "{name} a besoin d'aide"

#. Translators: {name} is the learner's name, {batch} the batch's and {why}
#. the reasons,
#. comma-separated.
msgid "{name} in {batch}: {why}."
msgstr "{name} dans {batch} : {why}."

msgid "{title}: your date has moved"
msgstr "{title} : votre date a été déplacée"

msgid "Your date of {title} now starts at {when}."
msgstr "Votre date pour {title} commence désormais le {when}."

msgid "{title}: your date is cancelled"
msgstr "{title} : votre date est annulée"

msgid ""
"The date of {title} you had a place on is cancelled. You can book another "
"date."
msgstr ""
"La date de {title} pour laquelle vous aviez une place est annulée. Vous "
"pouvez réserver une autre date."

msgid "{title}: you have a place"
msgstr "{title} : vous avez une place"

msgid "A place freed on {title} and you are booked for {when}."
msgstr ""
"Une place s'est libérée pour {title} et vous êtes inscrit pour {when}."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {count} how many hours until it
#. starts.
msgid "{title} starts in {count} hour"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {count} hours"
msgstr[0] "{title} commence dans {count} heure"
msgstr[1] "{title} commence dans {count} heures"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name.
msgid "{title} starts in 1 hour"
msgstr "{title} commence dans 1 heure"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name.
msgid "{title} starts in a few minutes"
msgstr "{title} commence dans quelques minutes"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {count} how many minutes until
#. it starts (5 or more).
msgid "{title} starts in {count} minute"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {count} minutes"
msgstr[0] "{title} commence dans {count} minute"
msgstr[1] "{title} commence dans {count} minutes"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {when} is its start date and
#. time.
msgid "Your booked date of {title} starts at {when}."
msgstr "La date que vous avez réservée pour {title} commence le {when}."

#. Translators: {name} is who raised it, {type} the ticket's type code (issue,
#. bug, feature, other) and {title}
#. its title.
msgid "{name} raised a new {type} ticket: {title}"
msgstr "{name} a ouvert un nouveau ticket {type} : {title}"

msgid "New support ticket"
msgstr "Nouveau ticket d'assistance"

msgid "Your support update"
msgstr "Mise à jour de votre demande d'assistance"

msgid "Your ticket {title} has been closed."
msgstr "Votre ticket {title} a été fermé."

msgid "Your ticket {title} has been reopened."
msgstr "Votre ticket {title} a été rouvert."

msgid "Ticket assigned to you"
msgstr "Ticket qui vous est attribué"

msgid "You have been assigned the ticket {title}."
msgstr "Le ticket {title} vous a été attribué."

#. Translators: {name} is who commented, {title} the ticket's title and
#. {comment} their words.
msgid "{name} commented on your ticket {title}: {comment}"
msgstr "{name} a commenté votre ticket {title} : {comment}"

msgid "New comment on your ticket"
msgstr "Nouveau commentaire sur votre ticket"
